> P.S., what is the origination of Mjollnir?  Does it have possibilities like
> Stormbringer?

Mjollnir is Thor's hammer, from Norse mythology.  Actually, to fully 
implement Mjollnir's mythical powers would be extremely unbalancing, as
the hammer is the favored weapon of the strongest warrior-god in the
mythos.  Powers include controlling storms, being thrown around corners,
flight (throw the hammer real hard and hold on tight), and travelling the
various planes (sort of like level teleport, but between games).
Of course, in mythology, Thor is the only being in the universe who can
lift the weapon (so you have to be polymorphed into Thor to wield it).
  


